{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069730/extras/b8ad91f6843a82211cf59fccdb294ed3.avif?t=1759248750\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critter'N Roll is a cute animal Twitch chat game where viewers compete as adorable rolling critters! Roll through diverse levels and environments while enjoying peaceful, charming atmospheres. Level up your animal, unlock customizations, and roll your way to victory alongside up to 20 other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069730/extras/898c307ec424152de450d6e9250275be.avif?t=1759248750\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply type &quot;!join&quot; in chat to enter the game as your chosen critter. Roll, bounce, and tumble through 7x7 grid levels filled with obstacles, paths, and surprises. Each level presents a unique challenge - find the exit, collect items, or survive environmental hazards while competing alongside fellow viewers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069730/extras/860efa5a7f78fe4366089fe110f30900.avif?t=1759248750\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Chat Integration</strong> - Commands are instant and easy to learn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Environments</strong> - From peaceful meadows to tricky maze levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal Customization</strong> - Unlock new critters and personalize your rolling friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamer Interaction</strong> - Broadcasters can influence gameplay and create memorable moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Atmosphere</strong> - Enjoy soothing visuals and sounds while you compete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Fun</strong> - Perfect for building viewer engagement and friendly competition</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for streamers looking to boost chat engagement and create inclusive, entertaining content for audiences of all ages.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2069730?t=1759248750","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069730/e747aaefc3f4820c9d85df0bed37b20d6b2ced6a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759248750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069730/e346f7a8943b160cee36af1d601c6dbe97eef133/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759248750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069730/e346f7a8943b160cee36af1d601c6dbe97eef133/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759248750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069730/extras/b8ad91f6843a82211cf59fccdb294ed3.avif?t=1759248750\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critter'N Roll is a cute animal Twitch chat game where viewers compete as adorable rolling critters! Roll through diverse levels and environments while enjoying peaceful, charming atmospheres. Level up your animal, unlock customizations, and roll your way to victory alongside up to 20 other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069730/extras/898c307ec424152de450d6e9250275be.avif?t=1759248750\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply type &quot;!join&quot; in chat to enter the game as your chosen critter. Roll, bounce, and tumble through 7x7 grid levels filled with obstacles, paths, and surprises. Each level presents a unique challenge - find the exit, collect items, or survive environmental hazards while competing alongside fellow viewers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069730/extras/860efa5a7f78fe4366089fe110f30900.avif?t=1759248750\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Chat Integration</strong> - Commands are instant and easy to learn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Environments</strong> - From peaceful meadows to tricky maze levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal Customization</strong> - Unlock new critters and personalize your rolling friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamer Interaction</strong> - Broadcasters can influence gameplay and create memorable moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Atmosphere</strong> - Enjoy soothing visuals and sounds while you compete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Fun</strong> - Perfect for building viewer engagement and friendly competition</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for streamers looking to boost chat engagement and create inclusive, entertaini